  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut sweet potato into thin wedges and place on the lined oven tray. Season with salt and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Toss to coat, then spread out in a single layer and bake until tender, 25-30 mins.\n• Meanwhile, thinly slice brown onion. Slice tomato into thin wedges. Roughly chop coriander. Drain sweetcorn.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-652776a4f285f81ee6311438-1c3daac3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Grate carrot. Using a paper towel, squeeze out any excess moisture.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook onion until tender, 4-5 mins.\n• In a medium bowl, combine carrot, corn, coriander, cooked onion, curry spice blend, Cheddar cheese, vegetable stock powder, the plain flour, egg, milk, and a pinch of pepper (if it's too wet, add more flour).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-652776a4f285f81ee6311438-a162ba43.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return pan to medium-high heat and add enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• When oil is hot, cook heaped spoonfuls of fritter mixture in batches, flattening with a spatula, until golden, 3-4 mins each side (don't flip too early!). You should get 3-4 fritters per person.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-652776a4f285f81ee6311438-49f86dde.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine tomato, salad leaves, a drizzle of olive oil and white wine vinegar. Season to taste.\n• Divide fritters, wedges and salad between plates.\n• Serve with garlic aioli.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-652776a4f285f81ee6311438-a4c4801c.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
